{
    //Events
"PelicanTownWholesale.0": "Almost finished there Robin?",
"PelicanTownWholesale.1": "Yep. Just putting the finishing touches on now.",
"PelicanTownWholesale.2": "Oh and there's @! You're just in time to see the new Pelican Town Wholesale stand.",
"PelicanTownWholesale.3": "Now that you've taken over the old farm, I thought that it might be nice for the rest of the town to have a place that they could place orders for some of your products.#$b#I'm sure it won't be long before you'll have quite the surplus of items that you'll be looking to sell.$h",
"PelicanTownWholesale.4": "For a matter of fact I'm currently in need of some fresh vegetables over at the Saloon. Do you think you would be able to supply some for me? I'd be willing to pay a little extra.#$b#And don't worry if you can't make it in time. Just check the board again next month and I'll put another order up.$h",
"PelicanTownWholesale.5": "And if all goes well I'd be willing to place regular orders for your crops @.#$b#When you have those vegetables be sure to bring them by.",
"PelicanTownWholesale.6": "For now it looks like the board is still empty though.#$b#Once you complete Gus' order though, I'm sure everyone else will start placing orders as well!$h",
"PelicanTownWholesaleSDS.0": "Oh there you are @! Are you almost finished there Robin?",
"PelicanTownWholesaleSDS.2": "Hey @! You're just in time to see the new Pelican Town Wholesale stand.",
"EggFestOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#The egg festival is coming up soon and we are in need of some eggs.$2",
"EggFestOrderEvent.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could supply the town with some eggs for the celebration?",
"EggFestOrderEvent.2": "Even if you're only able to gather 25 that would be helpful.#$b#But if you think that you could gather 100 eggs in the next seven days, I might be able to scrounge up a little surprise for you.$h",
"EggFestOrderEvent.3": "How many eggs do you think you can gather before the Egg Festival?",
"EggFestOrderEvent.4": "I think I can find 25 for you.",
"EggFestOrderEvent.5": "One hundred is a lot but I'll do it for the surprise.",
"EggFestOrderEvent.6": "I don't think I'll be able to get any for you Lewis.",
"EggFestOrderEvent.7": "Thank you @. And don't worry I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship the 25 eggs before the festival and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"EggFestOrderEvent.8": "Really!$h#$b#I know 100 eggs in only seven days is a lot @, but if you can pull it off I've got just the thing for you.#$b#Just make sure you ship the 100 eggs before the festival and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"EggFestOrderEvent.9": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the eggs somewhere else.$2",
"EggFestOrderEvent.10": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the festival on the 13th!$h",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#The egg festival is coming up in a few days and once again we need some eggs.$2",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could supply the town with some eggs for the celebration?",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.2": "Even if you're only able to gather 25 that would be helpful.#$b#I don't have any more ostrich eggs for you, but if you're able to get together 100 eggs again I'll be sure that you are compensated appropriately.$h",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.3": "How many eggs do you think you can gather before the Egg Festival?",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.4": "I think I can find 25 for you.",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.5": "One hundred it is!",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.6": "I don't think I'll be able to get any for you Lewis.",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.7": "Thank you @. And don't worry I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship the 25 eggs before the festival and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.8": "Really!$h#$b#I know 100 eggs in only seven days is a lot @, but if you can pull it off the whole town will have the best Egg Festival ever!$h#$b#Just make sure you ship the 100 eggs before the festival and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.9": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the eggs somewhere else.$2",
"EggFestOrderEvent2.10": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the festival on the 13th!$h",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#I know I was just here about the Egg Festival, but we could also use some help finding enough flowers for the Flower Dance.$2",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could supply the town with some flowers for the celebration?",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.2": "Even if you're only able to gather 25 that would be helpful.#$b#If you think that you can harvest 100 flowers before the dance, I think that I'll be able to find something nice for you.$h",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.3": "How many flowers do you think you can gather before the Flower Dance?",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.4": "I think I can find 25 for you.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.5": "One hundred is a lot but I need that surprise!",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.6": "I don't think I'll be able to get any for you Lewis.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.7": "Thank you @. And don't worry, I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship the 25 flowers before the dance and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.8": "Really!$h#$b#I know 100 flowers in only two weeks is a lot @, but if you can pull it off I have just the thing for you!$h#$b#Just make sure you ship the 100 flowers before the dance and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.9": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the flowers somewhere else.$2",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent.10": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the dance on the 24th!$h",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#I know I was just here about the Egg Festival, but we could also use some help finding enough flowers for the Flower Dance.$2",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could supply the town with some flowers for the celebration?",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.2": "Even if you're only able to gather 25 that would be helpful.#$b#I know you were able to gather 100 flowers last year, so do you think you would be able to that again this year?$h#$b#I won't be able to give you another butterfly hutch, but it will make everyone in town happy to see your beautiful flowers once again.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.3": "How many flowers do you think you can gather before the Flower Dance?",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.4": "I think I can find 25 for you.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.5": "One hundred it is!",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.6": "I don't think I'll be able to get any for you Lewis.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.7": "Thank you @. And don't worry, I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship the 25 flowers before the dance and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.8": "Really!$h#$b#I know 100 flowers in only two weeks is a lot @, but if you can pull it off everyone will be so happy!$h#$b#Just make sure you ship the 100 flowers before the dance and I will make sure to pick them up on my nightly rounds.",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.9": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the flowers somewhere else.$2",
"FlowerDanceOrderEvent2.10": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the dance on the 24th!$h",
"LuauOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#I'm here to ask for some help since it looks like the town is missing a few items for the upcoming Luau.$2",
"LuauOrderEvent.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could gather all of the items before Summer 10?",
"LuauOrderEvent.2": "We have a small list of a few vegetables that we need, and a larger list with several diverse ingredients.#$b#It might be hard to find everything on the large list if you're still getting settled in, but if you think you can do it, I will make sure that it is worth your while!$h",
"LuauOrderEvent.3": "Would you like to fulfill the small or the large list?",
"LuauOrderEvent.4": "I think I'll stick to the small list this time.",
"LuauOrderEvent.5": "Give me the large list!",
"LuauOrderEvent.6": "I don't think I'll be able to help you Lewis.",
"LuauOrderEvent.7": "Thank you @. And don't worry, I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship all of the items before Summer 11 and I will be sure to pick them up while doing my nightly rounds.",
"LuauOrderEvent.8": "Really!$h#$b#There are a lot of things on this list. Good luck gathering and shipping everything before Summer 11.#$b#I will make sure to pick them up from your shipping bin during my nightly rounds.",
"LuauOrderEvent.9": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the items somewhere else.$2",
"LuauOrderEvent.10": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the Luau on Summer 11!$h",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#I know it's really short notice, but we need some torches for the Dance of the Moonlight Jellies tomorrow night.$2",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could craft 100 torches for us before tomorrow?",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.2": "If we don't find some torches somewhere, we might not be able to attract the jellies.$2",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.3": "Would you be able to gather all of the torches for us?",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.4": "Of course Lewis!",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.5": "I don't think I'll be able to help you Lewis.",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.6": "Thank you @. And don't worry, I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship all of the torches before tomorrow and I will be sure to pick them up tonight.",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.7": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the items somewhere else.$2",
"MoonlightJelliesOrderEvent.8": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the beach tomorrow night!$h",
"SVFairOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#Gus just told me that he doesn't have enough ingredients for the annual burger bar at the Stardew Valley Fair.$2",
"SVFairOrderEvent.1": "Now I'm not sure if you would be able to, but do you think you could dig up enough ingredients for 50 Survival Burgers?#$b#That means 50 Eggplants, 50 pieces of bread, and 50 Cave Carrots.",
"SVFairOrderEvent.2": "If Gus doesn't have enough ingredients, we may have to shut down the burger bar this year.$2",
"SVFairOrderEvent.3": "Would you be able to gather all of the ingredients for him?",
"SVFairOrderEvent.4": "Of course Lewis! I can't let Gus down.",
"SVFairOrderEvent.5": "I don't think I'll be able to help you Lewis.",
"SVFairOrderEvent.6": "Thank you @. And don't worry, I'll be sure to compensate you for your time.#$b#Just ship all of the ingredients before Summer 16 and I will be sure to pick them up during my nightly rounds.",
"SVFairOrderEvent.7": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all. We will be sure to find the ingredients somewhere else.$2",
"SVFairOrderEvent.8": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at the fair on the 16th!$h",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#Spirit's Eve is just around the corner but we have two problems.$2",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.1": "First we don't have nearly enough pumpkins for decorations, but also Marlon says that there has been a large influx of monsters from the mines that might endanger the town.",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.2": "I was hoping that you would be able to help us out by growing 100 pumpkins and by slaying 50 of the monsters.#$b#Even if you can only tackle one of the problems that would be extremely helpful.",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.3": "Do you think that you can help the town out?",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.4": "Farming and monster hunting? Sign me up!",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.5": "I'm not sure about the monsters, but I'll grow those pumpkins for you.",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.6": "Farming is boring. Let me at those monsters!",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.7": "I don't think I'll be able to do either for you Lewis.",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.8": "I knew I could count on you @!$h#$b#Just make sure you put all of the pumpkins in your shipping bin before the 27th so that I can pick them up. And be careful slaying those monsters!",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.9": "I understand @. I'm not sure how Marlon handles the monsters coming out of those mines anyway?#$b#Just make sure all of the pumpkins are in the shipping bin before the 27th and I'll be sure to pick them up.$h",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.10": "Ok @. I wouldn't have taken you for the monster hunter type, but the town really appreciates you keeping the monsters at bay.#$b#Just make sure that all 50 have been slayed before the 27th.",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.11": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all.$2#$b#I think we can source the pumpkins from somewhere else, and hopefully Marlon will be able to keep the monsters at bay.$2",
"SpiritsEveOrderEvent.12": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you at Spirit's Eve on the 27th!$h",
"IceFestOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#It won't be long before the snow comes and with that the Festival of Ice isn't far behind.$h",
"IceFestOrderEvent.1": "Everyone is looking forward to building snowmen, but with the seasons changing I can't find any carrots.$2#$b#And what's a snowman without a carrot for a nose?$2",
"IceFestOrderEvent.2": "However, I did find a few carrot seeds laying around if you think you can grow 10 before Winter 8?#$b#We'll also need 50 pieces of coal for the buttons and eyes as well as 20 pieces of wood for the arms.",
"IceFestOrderEvent.3": "Can you find everything and grow the carrots before Winter 8?",
"IceFestOrderEvent.4": "Sure thing Lewis. Hopefully I have a Seed Maker laying around here somewhere...",
"IceFestOrderEvent.5": "I don't think I'll be able to Lewis.",
"IceFestOrderEvent.6": "I knew I could count on you @!$h#$b#I only have 5 carrot seeds but hopefully you can turn that into 10 carrots before the week is out.$h#$b#Just be sure to place everything in the shipping bin before the 8th.",
"IceFestOrderEvent.7": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all.$2#$b#I'm sure we will be able to scrounge up the materials from somewhere else.$2",
"IceFestOrderEvent.8": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#I look forward to seeing you on the 8th!$h",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.0": "Good morning @!$h#$b#The year is coming to an end, but it has been a good one hasn't it?",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.1": "Everyone is getting ready for the Feast of the Winter Star right now and I would like to set up a little surprise for the whole town.",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.2": "Wouldn't it be nice to give some fresh milk and warm cookies for everyone?$h#$b#I was hoping you could provide the milk and bake enough cookies for 20 people before the 25th?",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.3": "Would you be able to provide milk and cookies for the Feast of the Winter Star?",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.4": "Absolutely!",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.5": "I don't think I'll be able to Lewis.",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.6": "Thank you so much @!$h#$b#I'm sure the whole town will be overjoyed to sample your milk and cookies. Just please place them in the shipping bin before the 25th and I will be sure to pick them up.",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.7": "Well I'm sure you're busy around the farm and all.$2#$b#Even without the milk and cookies I'm sure it will be a wonderful festival.",
"WinterStarOrderEvent.8": "Anyway thank you for your time today @.#$b#Also make sure you check your mailbox to see who you have for the secret gift exchange and I hope to see you on the 25th!$h",
//Mail
"EggFest2OrderComplete.title": "100 Eggs Shipped for the Egg Festival",
"EggFest2OrderComplete.text": "@!^^Thank you so much for gathering all one hundred of those eggs for the town. It was one of the best Egg Festivals that Pelican Town has had in years. And don't worry, I didn't forget about that surprise I told you about.^^Included with this letter is an Ostrich Egg and an incubator that you can use to hatch it. I look forward to having some ostrich eggs at next years festival!^^",
"FlowerDance2OrderComplete.title": "100 Flowers Shipped for the Flower Dance",
"FlowerDance2OrderComplete.text": "@!^^Thank you so much for gathering all one hundred of those flowers for the town. It was one of the best Flower Dances that Pelican Town has had in years. And don't worry, I didn't forget about that surprise I told you about.^^Included with this letter is a Butterfly Hutch. I look forward to seeing you again at next years Flower Dance!^^",
"SVFairOrderComplete.title": "Burger Bar Saved",
"SVFairOrderComplete.text": "You saved the Stardew Valley Fair @!^^Thank you so much for gathering everything for the burger bar. Believe me when I say that I know how hard it is to find fifty Cave Carrots. And to show you just how much I appreciate the work that you did, I included some secret spices with this letter. Don't tell anyone or they will all know my cooking secrets!^",
"SpiritsEvePumpkinsComplete.title": "Pumpkins for Jack O' Lanterns",
"SpiritsEvePumpkinsComplete.text": "Thank you @!^^Those were some of the biggest and orangest pumpkins I've ever seen. They made perfect Jack O' Lanterns, and everyone at Spirit's Eve commented on how amazing the festival was thanks to your contribution.^^I don't have much to give you, but I did find some old scarecrows laying around that I thought you might be interested in. I look forward to seeing you next year!^",
"SpiritsEveMonstersComplete.title": "Spirt's Eve Monsters",
"SpiritsEveMonstersComplete.text": "Dear @,^^I must commend you on how you handled yourself in the mines. Something about Spirit's Eve excites the monsters in a way that I've never seen before.^^But you slayed many monsters without fear. And for for that you not only have my thanks but you also have my respect. As a small token of my apprecitaion I included one of the spare weapons that I happened to have lying around. Be safe and maybe I'll see you in the mines soon.^",
"WinterStarComplete.title": "Milk and Cookies",
"WinterStarComplete.text": "Dear @,^^It has been a pleasure working with you on these festival orders throughout the year. I know some of them were not easy, but I've learned that I can count on you when it matters most.^^Anyway the Feast of the Winter Star was another success, thanks in no small part due to your contribution. The milk and cookies were a hit! The whole town is praising you for that little surprise. And to show my thanks I've included a few presents for you as well. Enjoy the rest of the year and I will see you in the Spring! We do have an Egg Festival that we will need to prepare for soon.^",
